  "answer": "This has been reported before. In #49025, which is on the same version (0.100.2), a bookmark's icon and title are blank in the \"+\" list when editing the dock. They show up normally once the bookmark is added to the dock. So you can still pin it: click the blank entry in the \"+\" list and it will appear on the dock with its icon and name. The archived ticket has no fix for the blank entry. Related tickets (#46270, #48530) describe pinned bookmark icons disappearing on the dock. A fix for that was said to be in a PR that had not been merged as of 0.100, so watch those tickets for updates."
